# EXVS2-POC notes stay local

Do not record the EXVS2-POC project in this repository's committed history.

The native hook/DLL work lives in `E:\research\EXVS2-POC`. That tree is a
separate local project. Agents working from this repo must not:

- Copy POC source, `bngrw.dll`, game exe patches, or hook diaries into git
- Write POC development process markdown under `docs/` that would be committed
- Commit `vsac27_Release.exe` or any patched game image

Crash/ABI evidence that belongs in the MSC catalog may stay in
`docs/msc-research/` (example: `vs-player-hud-cost-index-oob.md`). That note
is the engine fact, not a POC changelog.

If a POC-only note is written under this tree, put it in a gitignored path:

- `docs/exvs2-poc/`
- files already listed in `.gitignore` for this rule

Those files stay on the local disk. They are not submitted.
